<title>USA: Dress Barn October same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Dress Barn October same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>SUFFERN, N.Y. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$50.3	$45.6	 +10	   +8</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $142.8     $137.4	  +4	   +2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended October 26.</p>
<p>Year-to-date is for the company's first quarter ended October 26.</p>
<p>Full company name is Dress Barn Inc.</p>
